# the screen reader (fm1-reader, announce.c): a reader listens, and each page, knob, help card, button and
# chord change is said once, in the screen's own text (the words file says it in full)
wait 200
listen
wait 100
said Cortex page: Tempo 58, Evolve 40, Motion 60, Drift 1 minute 17 seconds. Piece Hypnagogia, D Lydian, growing
# (the garden follows, queued: the chord, how far to the next, the scale from the root up)
listen
where
said Scale D, E, F#, Ab and A, B, C#
# a page settles before it is said
tap ENV
wait 300
said Voice 1 page: Level 60, Role Chord, Octave 0, Density 100
tap GLO
wait 300
said Setup page: Root D, Tune 0, MIDI out On, Lights On
# a knob: its name and value, once it settles
spin K2 3
wait 300
said Tune +3
spin K4 1
wait 300
said Lights Keys
spin K4 -1
wait 300
# SELECT turns the pages
turn SELECT -1
wait 300
said Space page: Echo 50, Echo time 2 bars, Reverb 80, Size 95
spin K2 -1
wait 300
said Echo time 1 bar
tap HOME
wait 300
said Cortex page: Tempo 58, Evolve 40, Motion 60, Drift 1 minute 17 seconds
spin K4 20
wait 300
said Drift 2 minutes 13 seconds
# HOME + SELECT: the tempo (the Garden's first knob says it)
press HOME
turn SELECT 2 200
release HOME
wait 300
said Tempo 59
# the keys: G into the scale and out (D Lydian has G#), C# out and back in; the root stays
tapkey w1
said ADDED G
tapkey w1
said REMOVED G
tapkey b3
said REMOVED C#
tapkey b3
said ADDED C#
tapkey w5
said THE ROOT STAYS (SETUP)
# the encoders: the mode, the piece (with its key and tempo)
turn ALGO 1
said MODE Mixolyd
turn ALGO -1
said MODE Lydian
turn PRESET 1
said PIECE Theta, A Dorian, tempo 66
wait 300
unsaid Level
turn PRESET -1
said PIECE Hypnagogia, D Lydian, tempo 60
wait 300
# the buttons' messages, said once
tap REC
said FREEZE ON
tap REC
said FREEZE OFF
tap PLAY
said RESTING
wait 300
unsaid GROWING
tap PLAY
said GROWING
wait 300
unsaid RESTING
tap OCT+
said VOICE 1 OCTAVE +1
tap OCT-
said VOICE 1 OCTAVE 0
tap EDIT
said NEXT CHORD ON THE BAR
# a help card: its button, then its lines
press SAVE
wait 1000
said SAVE button. SAVES ALL EIGHT PIECES. KEEP HOLDING: THE PIECE BACK TO ITS RECIPE
release SAVE
tap SAVE
said SAVED
press REC
wait 1000
said REC button. FREEZE: THE CHORD HOLDS AND THE REVERB RINGS ON. TAPE: OVERDUB, HELD: ERASE
release REC
wait 100
# the chord moving by itself: queued (said after what is being said)
wait 8000
said Chord
# a MIDI clock arriving, and start / stop from it
midi FA 00 00
midi F8 00 00
wait 20
said Tempo EXT
midi FC 00 00
wait 300
said RESTING
wait 1000
said Tempo 60
# WHERE: everything again
where
said Cortex page: Tempo 60, Evolve 40, Motion 60, Drift 2 minutes 13 seconds. Piece Hypnagogia, D Lydian, resting
